"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00180_6b14b66a456a","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What v0.5 covers","status_markers":[],"text":"- Ecology establishes road noise, seasonal transformation, predators, drainage, and resource gradients.
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00185_719229fc0b4d","block_type":"paragraph","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What is already closed","status_markers":[],"text":"<!--@3.3.3¶1-->
The old “unified event card layer” is not an untouched gap. v0.4.7 Cross-System Carryforward and Away have already restructured it:
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00188_9112e6f6c111","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What is already closed","status_markers":[],"text":"- Choice Events are authored state-changing packets;
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00189_03cc4ff6653d","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What is already closed","status_markers":[],"text":"- generic event-deck texture is rejected;
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00190_eefe9abb3644","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What is already closed","status_markers":[],"text":"- Field Cards stay sparse;
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00191_f9dab7cace32","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What is already closed","status_markers":[],"text":"- Road Work Impact does not necessarily open a full choice strip.
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00197_4311ba56047a","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What remains unresolved","status_markers":[],"text":"- whether Morning Rush / Midday / Evening Rush / Night Velocity remain the game-day cadence;
