"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00202_bad89d239480","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What remains unresolved","status_markers":[],"text":"- exact seasonal identities beyond the Home seasonal rhythm;
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00203_d36a1e178266","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What remains unresolved","status_markers":[],"text":"- Road Work cadence, local strike versus corridor-wide disruption, Margin wipe, Anchor interaction, bounded persistence, and recovery;
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00204_d68463040a37","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### What remains unresolved","status_markers":[],"text":"- how Road Work and other environmental pressure connect to the new Home Deficiency/MEET architecture without becoming a parallel event system.
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00209_f9e1b6b68285","block_type":"paragraph","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### Required ruling","status_markers":[],"text":"<!--@3.3.5¶1-->
