"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00214_e51b2b7f11f4","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### Required ruling","status_markers":[],"text":"- named environmental flavor that can be carried forward;
"},{"block_id":"M050-SRC-047-SURVIVORSHIP-REVIEW-001__B00215_dfd783fc436c","block_type":"list_item","estimated_claims":1,"parent_heading":"### Required ruling","status_markers":[],"text":"- and tuning values that remain provisional.
